#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:5
msgid "class SDCard -- SD / MMC card driver"
msgstr "class SDCard -- upravljački program za SD / MMC kartice"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :class:`SDCard` class drives the SD / MMC card slot on OpenMV cams that "
"have one. The driver implements the :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` interface "
"so it can be passed directly to :func:`vfs.mount`::"
msgstr ""
"Klasa :class:`SDCard` upravlja utorom za SD / MMC karticu na OpenMV kamerama"
" koje ga imaju. Upravljački program implementira sučelje "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` pa se može izravno proslijediti funkciji "
":func:`vfs.mount`\\ ::"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:20
msgid ""
"OpenMV firmware auto-mounts the SD card at boot, so most scripts never "
"construct an :class:`SDCard` directly -- they just read and write through "
"the auto-mounted path. Construct one manually only when you need a non-"
"default mount point or raw block-level access through :meth:`readblocks` / "
":meth:`writeblocks` / :meth:`ioctl`."
msgstr ""
"OpenMV firmware automatski montira SD karticu pri pokretanju, pa većina "
"skripti nikada izravno ne stvara objekt :class:`SDCard` -- one samo čitaju i"
" pišu kroz automatski montiranu putanju. Objekt stvarajte ručno samo kada "
"vam treba nestandardna točka montiranja ili izravan pristup na razini "
"blokova putem :meth:`readblocks` / :meth:`writeblocks` / :meth:`ioctl`\\ ."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:26
msgid ""
"On the OpenMV Cam M7 / H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal / N6 the slot is driven "
"by the STM32's on-chip SDMMC controller in 4-bit SD mode. On the OpenMV Cam "
"RT1062 the slot is driven by the i.MX RT's USDHC controller, also in 4-bit "
"SD mode. No pin-mux arguments are needed on any current OpenMV board -- the "
"driver knows the board's wiring."
msgstr ""
"Na OpenMV Cam M7 / H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal / N6 utorom upravlja STM32-ov"
" ugrađeni SDMMC kontroler u 4-bitnom SD načinu rada. Na OpenMV Cam RT1062 "
"utorom upravlja USDHC kontroler i.MX RT-a, također u 4-bitnom SD načinu "
"rada. Na nijednoj trenutnoj OpenMV ploči nisu potrebni argumenti za "
"mapiranje pinova -- upravljački program poznaje ožičenje ploče."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:32
msgid "Not exposed on the OpenMV Cam AE3 (alif port)."
msgstr "Nije dostupno na OpenMV Cam AE3 (alif port)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:35
msgid "Constructors"
msgstr "Konstruktori"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:39
msgid ""
"Return the :class:`SDCard` singleton for the SD slot identified by ``id``. "
"``id`` is accepted for cross-port compatibility but the OpenMV-supported "
"ports only expose one slot; pass ``1`` or omit it."
msgstr ""
"Vraća jedinstveni (singleton) objekt :class:`SDCard` za SD utor "
"identificiran s ``id``\\ . ``id`` se prihvaća radi kompatibilnosti između "
"portova, ali OpenMV-podržani portovi izlažu samo jedan utor; proslijedite "
"``1`` ili ga izostavite."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:44
msgid ""
"On STM32 the constructor takes no arguments at all; on mimxrt the ``id`` "
"argument is accepted but only ``1`` is valid."
msgstr ""
"Na STM32 konstruktor uopće ne uzima argumente; na mimxrt argument ``id`` se "
"prihvaća, ali valjan je samo ``1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:48
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Metode"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:52
msgid ""
"Return ``True`` if a card is currently detected in the slot, ``False`` "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Vraća ``True`` ako je kartica trenutno otkrivena u utoru, inače ``False``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:55
msgid ""
"On boards that wire a card-detect signal the method reflects that signal in "
"real time, so it can be polled after the :class:`SDCard` object has been "
"constructed to react to hot insertion / removal. On boards without a card-"
"detect signal the value is latched at construction time -- it reports the "
"result of the initial CMD0 probe the driver did when the object was created,"
" and a card hot-inserted afterwards will not be visible until the object is "
"re-constructed (or :meth:`init` is called on mimxrt)."
msgstr ""
"Na pločama koje ožičuju signal za otkrivanje kartice metoda odražava taj "
"signal u stvarnom vremenu, pa se može ispitivati nakon što je objekt "
":class:`SDCard` stvoren kako bi se reagiralo na umetanje / uklanjanje "
"tijekom rada. Na pločama bez signala za otkrivanje kartice vrijednost se "
"zaključava pri stvaranju objekta -- prijavljuje rezultat početne CMD0 "
"provjere koju je upravljački program obavio pri stvaranju objekta, a kartica"
" umetnuta tijekom rada nakon toga neće biti vidljiva dok se objekt ponovno "
"ne stvori (ili dok se na mimxrt ne pozove :meth:`init`\\ )."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:67
msgid "Return a 3-tuple describing the currently-inserted card:"
msgstr ""
"Vraća uređenu trojku (3-tuple) koja opisuje trenutno umetnutu karticu:"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:69
msgid ""
"``[0]`` ``num_blocks`` -- total capacity in 512-byte blocks. Multiply by 512"
" to get the raw byte capacity."
msgstr ""
"``[0]`` ``num_blocks`` -- ukupni kapacitet u blokovima od 512 bajtova. "
"Pomnožite s 512 da dobijete sirovi kapacitet u bajtovima."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:71
msgid ""
"``[1]`` ``block_size`` -- always ``512`` for SD cards. Included so callers "
"can do ``num_blocks * block_size`` portably."
msgstr ""
"``[1]`` ``block_size`` -- uvijek ``512`` za SD kartice. Uključeno kako bi "
"pozivatelji mogli prijenosno izračunati ``num_blocks * block_size``\\ ."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:74
msgid ""
"``[2]`` ``card_type`` -- the card type reported by the SD bus during the "
"CMD8 / OCR initialisation handshake. Typical values are ``0`` (SDSC -- "
"standard capacity), ``0x40`` (SDHC / SDXC -- high / extended capacity) and "
"``0x80`` (MMC)."
msgstr ""
"``[2]`` ``card_type`` -- tip kartice koji SD sabirnica prijavljuje tijekom "
"CMD8 / OCR inicijalizacijskog rukovanja. Tipične vrijednosti su ``0`` (SDSC "
"-- standardni kapacitet), ``0x40`` (SDHC / SDXC -- visoki / prošireni "
"kapacitet) i ``0x80`` (MMC)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:80
msgid ""
"Useful for sanity-checking that the card was recognised, or to display free-"
"space figures relative to total capacity."
msgstr ""
"Korisno za provjeru je li kartica prepoznata ili za prikaz podataka o "
"slobodnom prostoru u odnosu na ukupni kapacitet."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:85
msgid ""
"Turn the card slot's power rail on or off. STM32 firmware exposes the method"
" but no current OpenMV Cam gates the SD power supply, so the call is "
"effectively a no-op. Kept for compatibility with code originally written for"
" the upstream MicroPython STM32 reference boards. STM32 port only."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje ili isključuje napajanje utora za karticu. STM32 firmware izlaže "
"metodu, ali nijedna trenutna OpenMV Cam ne kontrolira napajanje SD-a, pa "
"poziv zapravo nema učinka. Zadržano radi kompatibilnosti s kodom izvorno "
"napisanim za referentne STM32 ploče iz izvornog MicroPythona. Samo STM32 "
"port."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:93
msgid ""
"Read a single 512-byte block from the card and return it as a newly-"
"allocated ``bytes`` object."
msgstr ""
"Čita jedan blok od 512 bajtova s kartice i vraća ga kao novostvoreni objekt "
"``bytes``\\ ."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:96
msgid ""
"This is the legacy single-block read shipped by the STM32 port. New code "
"should use :meth:`readblocks` instead -- that method works on every OpenMV "
"port, can read any number of contiguous blocks in one transfer, and avoids "
"the per-call allocation by writing into a caller-supplied buffer. STM32 port"
" only."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je naslijeđeno čitanje jednog bloka koje isporučuje STM32 port. Novi kod"
" umjesto toga treba koristiti :meth:`readblocks` -- ta metoda radi na svakom"
" OpenMV portu, može pročitati bilo koji broj uzastopnih blokova u jednom "
"prijenosu i izbjegava alokaciju po pozivu pišući u međuspremnik koji "
"isporučuje pozivatelj. Samo STM32 port."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:105
msgid ""
"Write a single 512-byte block to the card. ``data`` must be exactly 512 "
"bytes long."
msgstr ""
"Piše jedan blok od 512 bajtova na karticu. ``data`` mora biti točno 512 "
"bajtova dug."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:108
msgid ""
"This is the legacy single-block write shipped by the STM32 port; new code "
"should use :meth:`writeblocks` instead, which works on every OpenMV port and"
" can write any number of contiguous blocks per call. STM32 port only."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je naslijeđeno pisanje jednog bloka koje isporučuje STM32 port; novi kod"
" umjesto toga treba koristiti :meth:`writeblocks`\\ , koji radi na svakom "
"OpenMV portu i može zapisati bilo koji broj uzastopnih blokova po pozivu. "
"Samo STM32 port."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:116
msgid ""
"Read raw block-aligned data from the card into ``buf``. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Čita sirove podatke poravnate na blokove s kartice u ``buf``\\ . Standardna "
"ulazna točka blok-uređaja :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` koju koristi sloj "
"datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf)``): read whole blocks starting"
" at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of the SD "
"block size (512 bytes)."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavan oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): čita cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine SD bloka (512 bajtova)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): read "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. Used by littlefs and other "
"byte-addressable filesystems."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``readblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): čita "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . Koristi ga littlefs i drugi bajtno"
" adresabilni datotečni sustavi."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:133
msgid ""
"Write raw block-aligned data from ``buf`` to the card. Standard "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` block-device entry point used by the "
"filesystem layer."
msgstr ""
"Piše sirove podatke poravnate na blokove iz ``buf`` na karticu. Standardna "
"ulazna točka blok-uređaja :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` koju koristi sloj "
"datotečnog sustava."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:137
msgid ""
"**Simple form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``): write whole blocks "
"starting at block index ``block_num``. ``len(buf)`` must be a multiple of "
"the SD block size (512 bytes). Each affected block is overwritten in full."
msgstr ""
"**Jednostavan oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf)``\\ ): piše cijele "
"blokove počevši od indeksa bloka ``block_num``\\ . ``len(buf)`` mora biti "
"višekratnik veličine SD bloka (512 bajtova). Svaki zahvaćeni blok se u "
"cijelosti prepisuje."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:142
msgid ""
"**Extended form** (``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``): write "
"``len(buf)`` bytes -- not necessarily a whole number of blocks -- starting "
"at byte ``offset`` within block ``block_num``. Used by littlefs and other "
"byte-addressable filesystems."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni oblik** (\\ ``writeblocks(block_num, buf, offset)``\\ ): piše "
"``len(buf)`` bajtova -- ne nužno cijeli broj blokova -- počevši od bajta "
"``offset`` unutar bloka ``block_num``\\ . Koristi ga littlefs i drugi bajtno"
" adresabilni datotečni sustavi."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:150
msgid ""
"Standard :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` control entry point. Called by the "
"filesystem layer at mount/unmount time and on every sync. The recognised "
"``cmd`` values are:"
msgstr ""
"Standardna upravljačka ulazna točka :class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ . Poziva"
" ju sloj datotečnog sustava pri montiranju/demontiranju i pri svakoj "
"sinkronizaciji. Prepoznate ``cmd`` vrijednosti su:"

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:154
msgid "``1`` -- initialise. Return ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``1`` -- inicijalizacija. Vraća ``0`` u slučaju uspjeha."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:155
msgid "``2`` -- deinitialise. Return ``0`` on success."
msgstr "``2`` -- deinicijalizacija. Vraća ``0`` u slučaju uspjeha."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:156
msgid ""
"``3`` -- sync any pending writes. Returns ``0`` (the SDMMC driver writes "
"synchronously, nothing to flush)."
msgstr ""
"``3`` -- sinkronizira sva pisanja na čekanju. Vraća ``0`` (SDMMC upravljački"
" program piše sinkrono, nema ništa za pražnjenje)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:158
msgid "``4`` -- return the number of blocks on the device."
msgstr "``4`` -- vraća broj blokova na uređaju."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:159
msgid "``5`` -- return the size of a single block (always 512)."
msgstr "``5`` -- vraća veličinu jednog bloka (uvijek 512)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:161
msgid ""
"``6`` -- erase a block (no-op on SD, kept for the "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev` contract)."
msgstr ""
"``6`` -- briše blok (bez učinka na SD-u, zadržano radi ugovora "
":class:`vfs.AbstractBlockDev`\\ )."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:163
msgid "``7`` -- return whether the device supports block erase (0 on SD)."
msgstr "``7`` -- vraća podržava li uređaj brisanje blokova (0 na SD-u)."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:166
msgid ""
"Direct callers normally don't use this method -- the filesystem driver "
"dispatches all the standard codes automatically once the :class:`SDCard` is "
"mounted."
msgstr ""
"Izravni pozivatelji obično ne koriste ovu metodu -- upravljački program "
"datotečnog sustava automatski raspoređuje sve standardne kodove čim je "
":class:`SDCard` montiran."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:172
msgid ""
"Re-initialise the SD interface from scratch. Accepts the same arguments as "
"the constructor. Useful for re-detecting a hot-inserted card on boards "
"without a card-detect signal, since :meth:`present` is otherwise latched at "
"construction time. mimxrt port only."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno inicijalizira SD sučelje od početka. Prihvaća iste argumente kao "
"konstruktor. Korisno za ponovno otkrivanje kartice umetnute tijekom rada na "
"pločama bez signala za otkrivanje kartice, budući da je :meth:`present` "
"inače zaključan pri stvaranju objekta. Samo mimxrt port."

#: ../../library/machine.SDCard.rst:180
msgid ""
"De-initialise the SD interface, releasing the SDMMC/USDHC controller and the"
" IO pins it claimed. The :class:`SDCard` object becomes unusable until "
":meth:`init` is called again. Use it before re-flashing the card from "
"another interface, or to drop power to the slot in a battery-powered "
"application. mimxrt port only."
msgstr ""
"Deinicijalizira SD sučelje, otpuštajući SDMMC/USDHC kontroler i IO pinove "
"koje je zauzeo. Objekt :class:`SDCard` postaje neupotrebljiv dok se ponovno "
"ne pozove :meth:`init`\\ . Koristite ga prije ponovnog upisivanja kartice s "
"drugog sučelja ili za isključivanje napajanja utora u aplikaciji napajanoj "
"baterijom. Samo mimxrt port."
